{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: right\"><strong><i>Somewhere between dreams and reality lies a mysterious castle. According to legends, its mirrors are doors to other worlds, and how many of them there are is known by few.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: right\"><strong><i>But the legends say that sooner or later someone brave will come along who can pass through all its mirrors and become the rightful owner!</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Look into the mirror: everything there isn't quite as it is in our reality! Left becomes right, and right becomes left.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And what if the mirror is curved? The thin one gets fat, the fat one gets thin, the room floats and changes...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4067300/extras/f5197a2c93c600f2d1a500b5f5beefba.poster.avif?t=1774699760\" width=240 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4067300/extras/f5197a2c93c600f2d1a500b5f5beefba.webm?t=1774699760\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4067300/extras/f5197a2c93c600f2d1a500b5f5beefba.mp4?t=1774699760\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The point is that all &quot;rooms&quot; have reflections which differ from their real counterparts in some way. By transitioning into these reflections using mirrors, you can make your task easier: find an item needed, cut short the path, simplify a challenge... Each level has at least two solutions\u2014one without reflection and one with reflection.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4067300/extras/65431105c8bef88d3485b98676ff25ba.poster.avif?t=1774699760\" width=240 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4067300/extras/65431105c8bef88d3485b98676ff25ba.webm?t=1774699760\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4067300/extras/65431105c8bef88d3485b98676ff25ba.mp4?t=1774699760\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is a remake of a map I created long ago called &quot;Mirrors&quot; for Minecraft with mods.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a map\u2014it was made over two weeks and polished for six months afterward. As a game\u2014it depends on your support.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4067300/extras/307cace4249fcb5e1f745503727ed1ac.poster.avif?t=1774699760\" width=240 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4067300/extras/307cace4249fcb5e1f745503727ed1ac.webm?t=1774699760\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4067300/extras/307cace4249fcb5e1f745503727ed1ac.mp4?t=1774699760\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What's Ahead</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 corridors each containing 8 trial rooms. Every room is a miniature world. In the demo\u2014the first corridor is included.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >128 in-game achievements: 4 per room\u2014each achievement makes sense. 2 achievements\u2014for completing levels both ways and 2 more\u2014for hidden collectible cards scattered throughout the levels: one card in the reflection and another in reality (they may be given by characters upon completing tasks).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The castle transforms depending on the achievements you've obtained.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Puzzles, riddles, parkour, climbing...</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >References to numerous characters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jokes, parodies, and a touch of magic.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A main storyline and several endings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >VR headset compatibility</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4067300/extras/5fd775c1126f8b97540ed0976f00b4d4.poster.avif?t=1774699760\" width=240 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4067300/extras/5fd775c1126f8b97540ed0976f00b4d4.webm?t=1774699760\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4067300/extras/5fd775c1126f8b97540ed0976f00b4d4.mp4?t=1774699760\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4067300?t=1774699760","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4067300/e20e46f19ca2b6d96b20b46c46a7a99cfeaf4eb9/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1774699760","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4067300/8d866a5654107296f462a671b19535c759ee3130/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774699760","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4067300/8d866a5654107296f462a671b19535c759ee3130/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1774699760","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Cross-Platform Multiplayer","id":27},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Tracked Controller Support","id":52},{"description":"VR Supported","id":53},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Subtitle Options","id":65},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: right\"><strong><i>Somewhere between dreams and reality lies a mysterious castle. According to legends, its mirrors are doors to other worlds, and how many of them there are is known by few.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: right\"><strong><i>But the legends say that sooner or later someone brave will come along who can pass through all its mirrors and become the rightful owner!</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Look into the mirror: everything there isn't quite as it is in our reality! Left becomes right, and right becomes left.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And what if the mirror is curved? The thin one gets fat, the fat one gets thin, the room floats and changes...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4067300/extras/f5197a2c93c600f2d1a500b5f5beefba.poster.avif?t=1774699760\" width=240 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4067300/extras/f5197a2c93c600f2d1a500b5f5beefba.webm?t=1774699760\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4067300/extras/f5197a2c93c600f2d1a500b5f5beefba.mp4?t=1774699760\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The point is that all &quot;rooms&quot; have reflections which differ from their real counterparts in some way. By transitioning into these reflections using mirrors, you can make your task easier: find an item needed, cut short the path, simplify a challenge... Each level has at least two solutions\u2014one without reflection and one with reflection.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4067300/extras/65431105c8bef88d3485b98676ff25ba.poster.avif?t=1774699760\" width=240 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4067300/extras/65431105c8bef88d3485b98676ff25ba.webm?t=1774699760\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4067300/extras/65431105c8bef88d3485b98676ff25ba.mp4?t=1774699760\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is a remake of a map I created long ago called &quot;Mirrors&quot; for Minecraft with mods.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a map\u2014it was made over two weeks and polished for six months afterward. As a game\u2014it depends on your support.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4067300/extras/307cace4249fcb5e1f745503727ed1ac.poster.avif?t=1774699760\" width=240 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4067300/extras/307cace4249fcb5e1f745503727ed1ac.webm?t=1774699760\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4067300/extras/307cace4249fcb5e1f745503727ed1ac.mp4?t=1774699760\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What's Ahead</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 corridors each containing 8 trial rooms. Every room is a miniature world. In the demo\u2014the first corridor is included.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >128 in-game achievements: 4 per room\u2014each achievement makes sense. 2 achievements\u2014for completing levels both ways and 2 more\u2014for hidden collectible cards scattered throughout the levels: one card in the reflection and another in reality (they may be given by characters upon completing tasks).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The castle transforms depending on the achievements you've obtained.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Puzzles, riddles, parkour, climbing...</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >References to numerous characters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jokes, parodies, and a touch of magic.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A main storyline and several endings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >VR headset compatibility</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4067300/extras/5fd775c1126f8b97540ed0976f00b4d4.poster.avif?t=1774699760\" width=240 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4067300/extras/5fd775c1126f8b97540ed0976f00b4d4.webm?t=1774699760\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4067300/extras/5fd775c1126f8b97540ed0976f00b4d4.mp4?t=1774699760\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul>","developers":["Siorinex"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamst